Experiment No. 19
Kanchikan

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.460
Why does my class's homeroom always so long?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Experiment No. 19
Kanchikan

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.790
Sorry I'm late.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.070
Please don't rush onto the train.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.540
My apologies.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:24.460
Love always drives me, and yet…

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:36.800
The wind against the glass 
creates an image of you

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.270
What "color" will that wind be today?
I want to experience it, completely

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.310
Off in the corners of the classroom

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:48.610
Through the tiniest of magics

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:53.440
Another miracle occurs!

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:54.880
A premonition of love

00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:00.580
My heart shouldn't be so uneasy, 
I don't know what's next

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:05.540
Aah! What is it that throws 
my heart into turmoil?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.040
This sudden spark

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:12.800
Love always drives me, and yet…

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:17.380
Someone, someday, deliver 
these feelings to you!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.460
...pe me.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.170
Huh?

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:24.790
I said, "Grope me!"

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.040
Is she a pervert or something...?

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.420
Ma'am, what are you doing?

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.250
Hey! Don't go getting the wrong idea, Tanaka!

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.080
LOCAL LINE

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.880
This mock-up train requires
no additional fees, nor is it a free trial venue.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.170
SEMI EXPRESS

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.210
SPECIAL RAPID SERVICE

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.170
RAPID SERVICE

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.040
LIMITED EXPRESS

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.670
Instead, it is a proof-of-concept for...

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:40.250
a NEW type of molestation alert system!

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.330
The Kanchikan.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:46.500
This ornamental device forms
an ethereal bond with the mysterious spirit Kanchichi.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.330
The Spirit Kanchichi

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.540
When notice of lewd behavior is received, a Spirit
Meeting is held and

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.830
Spirit Meeting

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.650
should judgment be handed down,

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.460
Spirit Meeting
Out                        Safe
Safe                                               Safe
Safe                                                                        Out

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.010
an alert is sent to the 
humans in the vicinity.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.750
ANNIHILATION

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.330
Available in four colors!

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.710
Now do it, Tanaka! Show me the groping
techniques you've so expertly refined!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.510
Um, I've never done that before...

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.580
I don't really understand
what would make a person do it.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:11.040
Now look here, Tanaka:
I'm not asking you to weigh in on the morality of it!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.300
Just consider that when 
complete, this device will be

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.030
a savior to all those who 
have suffered groping!

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.710
I understand. Okay, I'll be the pervert.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.790
Ma'am, that thing's really going off...

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.510
Yes, well, this is how it reacts
when in the presence of a groper.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.710
So, is the experiment over?

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.010
Hey! It hasn't even started yet!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.510
Just wait here. I'll be back soon.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:53.080
Ma'am...

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.040
Pipe down!

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.670
Time out!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.000
WAIT!!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.500
Caw! Caw! Caw-razy!

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.040
Ma'am...

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.130
Yes?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.510
The plan as it was explained before was...

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.080
because the device won't 
react to light contact,

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.330
that would force a gradual 
escalation of conduct,

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.420
leading to the possibility 
that a line will be crossed.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.670
Restricted

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.040
That's how the explanation went, I believe.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.210
Ma'am, are you listening?

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:39.030
Yes, sorry. I'm listening.
You're asking, like, "Why?" and stuff.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.790
Shall we stop it?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:42.750
Huh?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.040
The device. Shall we turn it off?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:54.000
I just... I can't seem to cross that line!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.790
Then you'll have to do your best.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.460
Do you understand, Ma'am?
I'd like to confirm one more time...

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.800
The plan is that, the more restraint you have,


00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.390
the more extreme the 
behavior will become, yes?

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:09.010
You don't have to tell me that AGAIN!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.040
Day duty

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.580
Tanaka. Sorry to keep you waiting...

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.380
Do you know what happened?

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:22.830
Ma'am, are you okay? You 
seem sort of out of it.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:27.830
I feel like I'm catching a cold.
I guess the device malfunctioned...

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.380
If you feel so bad that it malfunctions,
then it's not much use.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.920
We're not done yet...

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.290
Is she all right?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.000
Yes! That's the spirit.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.830
She has the eyes of a rotting fish...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.170
Just keep yourself in check until
you've reached the promised land!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.290
Hurry up and do it, Tanaka.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.510
Yes, yes.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.210
Okay, Ma'am. Here goes.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:57.460
Limited Express

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.040
Commuter Semi Special Express

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.880
Ma'am, why don't we stop here for today?

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:15.540
I... I hate them! I hate these
hands that refuse to cooperate!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:20.040
Ma'am, let's get your body 
nice and rested first.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.250
After all, nothing's more 
important than your health.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:41.080
Experiment No. 20
Repara-te

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.380
Huh?

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.210
Is this a burn mark?

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:47.250
This desk sure is beat up, huh?

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.000
That beat-up thing will become...

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:51.330
As good as new!

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:54.880
The Repara-te.

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:58.880
The device scans what it touches and then
uses nano-particles to grind down the surface.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:03.000
Once the impurities are removed,
the resulting shavings are used on a nano level

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.670
to repair and reconstruct.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.550
By restoring the missing particles,
the surface takes on a uniform appearance.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.080
In other words, swipe it like this and...

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.540
Whoa! It's bright and sparkly.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.920
This part here looks brand new!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:21.540
It grinds down the surface AND repairs it at
the same time. That's easy to understand, yes?

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.040
However, that is only its 
secondary application.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.530
It's primary use is...

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.790
to remove unwanted body hair!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:34.000
A simple stroke of these gloves
will eliminate unwanted hair in an instant!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.710
It simultaneously provides skin care,
leaving it silky smooth!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.040
Whoa...

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.830
Well, Tanaka? Curious to 
try out a little rubbing?

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.000
Yes, definitely!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.880
I wonder if legs would 
give the best result...

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.010
My, how brazen you are today!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:55.630
Just what technique will you use with the
aim of making these legs be called "shapely"?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:03.670
Not YOUR legs! You can get
rid of that shin hair however you like!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.960
Are you after the milky-white 
skin of a fair maiden?!

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.330
Oh. Is that what you meant?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.380
All right, well... Let's do this.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.960
Huh? Ma'am...

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:17.960
Do you even grow leg hair?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.010
Not good. This man is...

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.750
He's the type that thinks 
girls don't grow leg hair.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:35.580
This has gone past the intended purpose,

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.670
arriving at an unexpected state where
mysterious and PRIVATE areas are revealed.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.920
At this rate, her spirit is likely to...!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:47.500
Actually, Tanaka-senpai, girls 
generally do grow leg hair.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.460
Huh? Really?!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:54.040
But girls' legs are always smooth,
so I thought that's just how it was.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.170
Because we trim it.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.710
Huh. I never knew.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.540
So, Yamashita-san, you do it too?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.540
Actually, I'm the type who 
doesn't grow much hair.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.500
Huh? Which is it?!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.540
This conversation is already contradictory!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:13.510
Girls normally DO grow hair. 
I'm probably a bit unusual.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:18.210
Tanaka-senpai, you have two younger sisters,
right? So, you should have a general idea.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.670
Mmm, I never paid much 
attention to their leg hair.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.420
I'm going to go ask them about it.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.790
Please ask about that once you're back home.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:33.040
But you're curious too, right?
If I can't come up with an answer HERE, we'll regret it.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.920
I'll be back soon!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:37.920
Glance.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.460
Facing Sudden
Out-of-body
Experiences
14 Rules

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.500
I asked them about it!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.330
According to them...

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.210
Leg hair?! Mine is SUPER fine,
so I don't do anything in particular.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.510
But would you mind not asking 
a question like that?!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.080
That sort of thing bugged 
me from a young age,

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.880
so I borrowed some stuff from Mom
and got them all silky-smooth!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.540
You really have no sense of delicacy, do you?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.170
That's what they said.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.540
They had different opinions...
So, when you talk about "normal,"

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.500
is it REALLY normal?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.540
Suddenly, I'm not so confident either.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.460
Still, Ma'am, you grow hair, don't you?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:20.330
Our club captain
is currently napping and unable to respond.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:24.670
Right now, those who DON'T
grow seem to be in the majority.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.000
Hmm.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.000
Hmm.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.380
Someone else I might be able to ask is...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.010
SCIENCE

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.010
And so,

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:37.830
I was hoping to ask your 
opinion, Kitanaga-senpai.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.010
Oh, I get it!

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.630
Let's see...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.390
I'd have to conclude that...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:49.000
when it comes to leg hair, girls...

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.080
tend to...

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:51.670
grow it!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.540
Whoa...

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.920
Oh, is that so?

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.530
Well, of course!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:03.130
I'm in the Swimming Club,
so I see a lot of female bodies,

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:06.040
and naturally smooth legs are SUPER rare!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.000
This is the exception!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:14.000
So, I guess I was overthinking things.
I'm glad the mystery's been sorted out!

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.630
It's normal for girls to grow hair, huh?

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.790
Right?
